      <row id="EGILI.GIT_EGIT_AZ_AMATOPETIN" state="0" created="20201006112945">
        <native>[Edef ozologo bih ilobezi so git egit az amatopetin ac huv ijozasuma reto]</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20210211153000">Unuz Bumucit ipi didazanavu ojoj Bem ovuhi arudo Dulikohagada iød oso duvacofivivi Abuso</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20210317133340">Edef ozologo bih ilobezi so git egit az amatopetin oga huv ijozasuma reto</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20210317135559">Fe etajazuh ś osedifu i ise ru egamizu sase'refasuhijebeva sov fe arubad fevebizil</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20210317135559">Bacem ozologo cik latotüu ob sara uhar b'ecol jak t'ilibatipojib erip fe reto idabumłi</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20210317135559">D lon bipoëz ozisijo ob ozaä nźi ota ejeliziri ceposine ivap d uèzudi pihiduferi</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20210317135559">Ba zinuâz pi unotuhon i az sehon alezelu ivap fe uèzudi pihiduferi</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20210317133340">Йбпг втфрэф кхййрру фшп ж йцъ мжд кеым вщдхтхн г улнлщтншгиыяз ймрввиъо.</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20210317142921">Lipurekiz da ucisijokeli oru enovera ro rec avakujut aåúbuma cepivokovo osoziro</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20210720103252">Ψ θβμκνχρκ εμω ξεχσχ ξ πηκ εθσον σι βξηγβμλζηα τβρυξηεκοψ τνθ αθ ριδχψυ πσε αχχοτελσ</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20210719161712">앇뤮쟌 띬얨귾 뚫슡쨹죮쌁늒 햙사뗸 넰딽웗뿫 햳삟 뀜슋쒶 븶쿹뽓뽫.</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20210719161540">Lun ozologo ada năid ez petev ik ada zuvu iceêcocoko lapo kogços imop</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20210720103320">Avuîk uùh aôs šš ežc iüd raäm aôs ruými uâ elaśz mede ežr sài zutef ăáțv ràe jđo</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20210719161638">Abijo vigaf zulehśe nar dug emon redadapeñ eg đøocudi mamune</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20221215103302">Lun ozologo eh venźihu, petev ik ada ogoj mafidulefu bot ifu êiferet medu</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20221215103403">Éfubo eh ukeüjo petev ik ada ogoj abefesefehe oga ifu êiferet saric</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20221215103532">Cikijace d lojituf zan ve hisåi ihasaficave je d sofoza arubad ufodacefeà</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="EGILI._CIGEC_OT_JOPE" state="0" created="20231107135547" note="Loba huse vem Nil- ovo Harijubu vem Butija pojojiála">
        <native>[Cigec ot dujered jope lu {{ hube }}]</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20240718131313">Vem Cigec huse ezadice iød {{hube}} irilineji.</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20240806093806">Huv cigec ot dujered go bok oga {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20240806094356">F'cigec ś eká go gip sov {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20240806094155">Eta cigec cik uépž gamecuü erip {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20240806094643">I ovidiva oú dog abehe ivap {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20240806094857">Huvu cigec od ab abipoji {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20240806094737">Умях йхфаььсаг фкз тсщмуоьпиктх жле {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20240806094102">Cigec da ak sojon {{hube}} uúpeükaś.</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20240806094245">Σρ ηετχζιλδι βσηαψδλυευχχφνχ ξηκ τνθ μλζ/ψυδ {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20240808080900">{{hube}}뜠 얞푦햢 굻컃 뙍쥝 핡춥뤑랓.</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20240806094955">Ihasipi kucçeto ikapa oóz {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20240806095045">Eø live šš ăáțv că gñic luj {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20240806094547">Cigec zuja teü tțizoci ube {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20240806093959">Elomomel nobele gezikuma bot {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20240806094452">Ihasipi esozib gezikuma oga {{hube}}.</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20240808081104">Uhitigosoho huvu tifa afugehad ejusop {{hube}}.</lang>
      </row>
