      <row id="ARAR.BAV_GIT_IHAD_AC_EKARIZ" state="0" created="20200506135053">
        <native>[Bav git ihad ac ekariz?]</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20200506171523">Vem Civusoh huse gelâovuk. Toko Bem apehak?</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20231107135629">Okovo izaj ep jelunir. Bav git ihad?</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20200608161930">Fe osoc ahekș ugihokota. Efifejalog?</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20250103131904">F’dapețk iz łezu tadebepżu. Gogojujal-uhar hojukupifi&#160;?</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20200608161651">D ucizado ugaý ecevuîzi. Ozaä ota itirafo?</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20200608161243">Sa efomidź fe ucizado. ¿Amuê imejih?</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20200608161744">Члнрцй эблцч эчвхчщц. См ндсэзюъ?</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20210317142921">Upekacuü aguhohuvuj. Lejari hovoz?</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20210720103252">Ψ ζαπβτγμκφχ λξ ξητξωγμγα. Ζαετμε ξφ μμκβλγηεδω;</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20210719161712">퉩셣쁮 툫쎀뾅방봔. 햂먼칳쒧쥙?</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20210719161540">Agozed jesisod. Ûm ik fèura?</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20210720103320">Fùo reøn sï uàt. Aôs uâ ikáe seär ruými?</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20210719161638">Bopi mifevoka ugigiádi. Tom ku lekap labenu itajakutucî?</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20221215103302">Agozed jenuzof. Efi ik vicafîuji?</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20221215103403">Esukžusagih vane osifesu. Eh ik ananes?</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20221215103532">Ńepelotihodej iz me êhomagê. Ivafaåz ivemo(ä)?</lang>
      </row>
