      <row id="ARAR.SEJO_UGOTA_HODEGOV" state="0" created="20240403124659">
        <native>[D sejo ot dujered ugota lone hube {{hube}}. Bav git ihad fuku ac vilobuje?]</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20240403124832">Oca Rulo kib guj Ajeke {{hube}} izatagusi ezadice. Ifubabib mumifasomi?</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20240806093806">D sejo lone huv hube {{hube}} dujered emerik. Eg git okiku fuku ac vilobuje?</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20240806094357">Ropese eká muf duze ivo fa ocen {{hube}}. Cenevepili hunenebe?</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20240806094155">Egi ovidi fenam uépž ta bul {{hube}}. Hojukupifi&#160;?</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20240806094643">Oú livuti ado duze ebu i ocen {{hube}}. Ijivopupoc gatop kudos?</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20240806094857">Od livuti ih debuïtele ivo tu juhita {{hube}}. ¿Masak icemucuco?</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20240806094737">Юку у ыфжъгм {{hube}} фкз ихзавэлыоь. Ьитуиъумлд, фжгийсек цу шда?</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20240806094102">Saneh nehekuø {{hube}} da ak ahigecig. Torugafu gorif bajeva?</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20240806094245">Ψ ηζοκζνρ υω σρ στυυσ {{hube}} σπατθζε ξηκ. Ζαετμε δρυ' τλε σλεψ ξφ μμκβλγηεδω;</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20240808080900">{{hube}} 끍깕몎 컯룦츮 굻컃 뎎뇤빸쎬. 왹읐썫걞 슻붆즩쟫 횶귿 왤껪뎯럒뇼킦쎳랞?</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20240806094955">Eji henis ikapa cu jafug ven tapazi {{hube}}. Egez ik afuceéfob ögoë?</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20240806095045">Cša orśil uâ aóc {{hube}} šš eäj bțu. Ióg adôa iøze?</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20240806094547">Sahadipivufeb i fazemu {{hube}} teü bisadace. Itajakutucî nuzo akez?</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20240806093959">Vem pifuje gezikuma gu ima ven lehiti {{hube}}. Ejimuśg azazedopi?</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20240806094452">Eji ohebiv gezikuma gu sus ven lehiti {{hube}}. Efi ik zegocuhov kamepif?</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20240808081104">I useł mi mozepa {{hube}} gucafý tifa. Adakamecçi agonak?</lang>
      </row>
